<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<% const canonical = 'https://www.reviewreply.store/' + (page ? page.slug + '-reviews' : ''); %>
<% if (page) { %>
  <title><%= page.title %> | ReviewReply</title>
  <meta name="description" content="<%= page.desc %>">
<% } else { %>
  <title>Google Review Reply Generator: Free AI Replies in Seconds | ReviewReply</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Paste a Google review, pick a tone, get a polite, specific reply in seconds. Free for reviews up to 300 characters. Works for positive and negative reviews.">
<% } %>
  <link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonical %>">
  <meta property="og:url" content="<%= canonical %>">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="<%= page ? page.title : 'Reply to Google reviews in seconds' %>">
  <meta property="og:description" content="<%= page ? page.desc : 'Paste a review, pick a tone, get a reply you can post. Free for short reviews.' %>">
<%- include("partials/assets") %>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[
    {"@type":"WebApplication","name":"ReviewReply","url":"https://www.reviewreply.store/","applicationCategory":"BusinessApplication","operatingSystem":"Any (web browser)","description":"AI reply generator for Google reviews. Paste a review, choose a tone and get a reply to post.","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","name":"Free","price":"0","priceCurrency":"USD"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Starter","price":"9","priceCurrency":"USD"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Pro","price":"19","priceCurrency":"USD"}]},
    {"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Does replying to Google reviews help SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Google lists responding to reviews among its tips for improving local ranking, because it shows you value customers. It does not say replies are a direct ranking factor. The clearest benefit is with the customers who read your profile."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Is ReviewReply free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, for reviews up to 300 characters, with all four tones. Paid plans remove the length limit."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Does it work for negative reviews?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Choose the Empathetic tone for an apologetic, solution-focused reply. Always add the specific fix or contact details before posting."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"What languages does it reply in?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It replies in the language of the review. Quality is best in widely used languages such as English, Spanish, German, French, Italian and Portuguese; check replies in other languages before posting."}}
    ]}
  ]}
  </script>
  <style>
    .hero{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 20px 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}
    .hero .kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green);background:var(--green-soft);padding:5px 12px;border-radius:99px}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,60px);line-height:1.02;font-weight:700;margin:18px 0 16px}
    .hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--green)}
    .hero p.lede{font-size:18.5px;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:520px}
    .hero .ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:26px}
    .hero .btn{height:50px;padding:0 24px;font-size:16px}
    .demo{position:relative}
    .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px -30px rgba(19,38,31,.35)}
    .card .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
    .card .av{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#e9e1cf;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .card .st{color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:14px}
    .card .st .off{color:#d9d2c2}
    .card p{margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .reply{margin:14px 0 0 34px;border-color:#cfe0d5;background:#f6faf7}
    .reply .who{color:var(--green)}
    .ex{position:absolute;top:-12px;right:14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px}
    #tool{scroll-margin-top:80px;max-width:820px;margin:28px auto 0;padding:0 20px}
    .tool{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--green)}
    .tool h2{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .frow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .flabel{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .tool input,.tool select,.tool textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 12px}
    .tool textarea{min-height:130px;resize:vertical}
    .tool input:focus,.tool select:focus,.tool textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--green-soft)}
    .tool .gen{width:100%;height:52px;margin-top:14px;font-size:16px}
    .tool small{display:block;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:10px}
    .result{margin-top:18px;border:1px solid #cfe0d5;background:#f6faf7;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px}
    .result .lbl{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green)}
    .result .txt{margin-top:8px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:15.5px}
    .result .copy{margin-top:12px;height:40px;font-size:14px}
    .limit{margin-top:18px;border:1px solid #efd9a8;background:#fdf6e6;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    section.band{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:72px 20px 0}
    section.band>h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,38px);line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;max-width:640px}
    section.band>p.sub{color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:10px;max-width:640px}
    .steps3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:28px}
    .steps3 div{border-top:3px solid var(--green);padding-top:14px}
    .steps3 b{font-family:var(--head);font-size:19px;display:block;margin:6px 0}
    .steps3 span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
    .steps3 p{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15.5px}
    .industry{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;margin-top:22px}
    .industry ul{margin:10px 0 0 20px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:28px}
    .plan{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .plan.pop{border:2px solid var(--green)}
    .plan .nm{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}
    .plan .pr{font-family:var(--head);font-size:42px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 0}
    .plan .pr small{font-family:'Inter';font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)}
    .plan ul{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 20px;display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .plan li::before{content:"✓";color:var(--green);font-weight:700;margin-right:8px}
    .plan .btn{margin-top:auto;width:100%}
    .faqs{max-width:760px}
    .faqs details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0}
    .faqs summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .faqs summary::after{content:"+";color:var(--muted)}
    .faqs details[open] summary::after{content:"–"}
    .faqs p{margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink-2)}
    .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:18px}
    .chips a{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:99px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}
    .chips a:hover{border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green)}
    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px;padding-top:36px}.plans{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @media(max-width:640px){.frow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tool{box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--green);padding:18px}.reply{margin-left:14px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include("partials/nav") %>

<header class="hero">
  <div>
    <span class="kicker">★ Google review reply generator</span>
    <% if (page) { %>
      <h1><%= page.title %></h1>
      <p class="lede"><%= page.desc %></p>
    <% } else { %>
      <h1>Reply to every Google review <em>in seconds.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Paste a review, pick a tone, and get a polite, specific reply you can post. Positive, mixed or angry: you&#39;ll never stare at a blank box again.</p>
    <% } %>
    <div class="ctas"><a href="#tool" class="btn">Write a free reply</a><a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-ghost">See pricing</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="demo" aria-label="Example review and reply">
    <span class="ex">Example</span>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="who"><span class="av">JM</span><div>J. M.<div class="st">★★<span class="off">★★★</span></div></div></div>
      <p>Food was good but we waited 40 minutes for a table even though we had a booking. Nobody told us why.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card reply">
      <div class="who">Reply from the owner</div>
      <p>Thank you for telling us, and I&#39;m sorry. A 40-minute wait with a booking isn&#39;t acceptable, and you should have been kept informed. We&#39;ve changed how we manage bookings on busy evenings. I&#39;d love the chance to host you again; please ask for me when you book.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div id="tool">
  <div class="tool">
    <h2>Write a reply</h2>
    <form method="POST" action="/generate">
      <div class="frow">
        <label><div class="flabel">Your email</div><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@business.com" value="<%= email %>" required></label>
        <label><div class="flabel">Tone</div>
          <select name="tone">
            <option value="friendly">Friendly</option>
            <option value="professional">Professional</option>
            <option value="empathetic">Empathetic (for complaints)</option>
            <option value="witty">Witty</option>
          </select></label>
        <label><div class="flabel">Plan</div><input type="text" value="<%= isPro ? 'Paid · any length' : 'Free · up to 300 characters' %>" readonly></label>
      </div>
      <label><div class="flabel">Customer review</div><textarea name="review" placeholder="Paste the Google review here…" required><%= review %></textarea></label>
      <button type="submit" class="btn gen">Write my reply</button>
      <small>Free for reviews up to 300 characters. Read every reply before you post it.</small>
    </form>

    <% if (result === 'FREE_LIMIT') { %>
      <div class="limit"><span>This review is longer than 300 characters. Paid plans reply to reviews of any length.</span><a href="#pricing" class="btn">See plans</a></div>
    <% } else if (result && result.length > 0) { %>
      <div class="result">
        <div class="lbl">Your reply</div>
        <div class="txt" id="replyText"><%= result %></div>
        <button class="btn copy" type="button" onclick="copyReply(this)">Copy reply</button>
      </div>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</div>

<% if (page && page.tips) { %>
<section class="band">
  <h2><%= page.tipsTitle %></h2>
  <div class="industry">
    <ul><% page.tips.forEach(function(t){ %><li><%= t %></li><% }) %></ul>
  </div>
</section>
<% } %>

<section class="band" id="how">
  <h2>Good replies, without the blank-page feeling</h2>
  <p class="sub">A reply shows the reviewer, and everyone reading after them, that someone is listening. ReviewReply writes the first draft; you add the details only you know.</p>
  <div class="steps3">
    <div><span>01</span><b>Paste the review</b><p>Copy it from your Google Business Profile, or any other review site.</p></div>
    <div><span>02</span><b>Pick a tone</b><p>Friendly, professional, empathetic for complaints, or a little witty for regulars.</p></div>
    <div><span>03</span><b>Check and post</b><p>The reply mentions what the customer said and your type of business. Edit, copy and post it.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="pricing">
  <h2>Simple pricing</h2>
  <p class="sub">Start free. Pay only if you need to reply to longer reviews or want the Chrome extension.</p>
  <div class="plans">
    <div class="plan">
      <div class="nm">Free</div>
      <div class="pr">$0</div>
      <ul><li>Reviews up to 300 characters</li><li>All four tones</li><li>Replies in the review&#39;s language</li></ul>
      <a href="#tool" class="btn btn-ghost">Start free</a>
    </div>
    <div class="plan pop">
      <div class="nm">Starter</div>
      <div class="pr">$9 <small>/ month</small></div>
      <ul><li>Reviews of any length</li><li>All four tones</li><li>Email support from the maker</li></ul>
      <a href="https://dorukctn.gumroad.com/l/qkcxwv" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">Get Starter · $9/month</a>
    </div>
    <div class="plan">
      <div class="nm">Pro</div>
      <div class="pr">$19 <small>/ month</small></div>
      <ul><li>Everything in Starter</li><li>Chrome extension for replying where you read reviews</li><li>Priority email support</li></ul>
      <a href="https://dorukctn.gumroad.com/l/wyaezo" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">Get Pro · $19/month</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="sub" style="font-size:14px;margin-top:14px">Billed through Gumroad. Cancel anytime from your Gumroad account.</p>
</section>

<section class="band faqs">
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <details><summary>Does replying to Google reviews help SEO?</summary><p>Google lists responding to reviews among its tips for improving local ranking, because it shows you value customers. It does not say replies are a direct ranking factor. The clearest benefit is with the people reading your profile. <a href="/blog/does-responding-to-reviews-help-seo">Read more</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Is ReviewReply free?</summary><p>Yes, for reviews up to 300 characters, with all four tones. Paid plans remove the length limit.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Does it work for negative reviews?</summary><p>Yes. Choose the Empathetic tone for an apologetic, solution-focused reply. Always add the specific fix or contact details before posting. <a href="/blog/negative-review-response-templates">See templates</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What languages does it reply in?</summary><p>It replies in the language of the review. Quality is best in widely used languages such as English, Spanish, German, French, Italian and Portuguese; check replies in other languages before posting.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Should I post the reply exactly as written?</summary><p>Read it first. Add names, the specific fix and contact details, and remove anything that isn&#39;t true for your business.</p></details>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <h2>Replies by industry</h2>
  <div class="chips">
    <a href="/restaurant-reviews">Restaurants</a><a href="/dentist-reviews">Dentists</a><a href="/hotel-reviews">Hotels</a><a href="/negative-reviews">Negative reviews</a>
    <a href="/blog/google-review-reply-examples-restaurants">Restaurant examples</a><a href="/blog/how-to-respond-to-google-reviews">How to respond</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>

<script>
function copyReply(btn) {
  var t = document.getElementById('replyText');
  if (!t || !navigator.clipboard) return;
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(t.innerText).then(function () {
    btn.textContent = 'Copied';
    setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = 'Copy reply'; }, 2000);
  });
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
